      "content": "TL 00 NE                    ST MICHAEL           HEMEL HEMPSTEAD ROAD                                                  (north side)                                                  LEVERSTOCK GREEN 8/292                                            N and E ranges of                                                  outbuildings bounding the 6.3.78                                           main yard at Corner Farm GV                                               II Former cowsheds and stabling.  Early C19 and c.1900.   Timber frame.  Plain tile roof.   Weatherboarded N range has 5 narrow bays with restored clasped purlin roof, one tie beam bearing dates 1813 and 1823.  E range is c.1900.  Slate roof.   Single storey.  Mostly open bays. Listing NGR: TL0976606144"
